{"event_index": 7, "event": "model_process", "at_utc": "2026-11-05T05:36:33.157255+00:00", "stage": "init_01", "retry": false, "result": {"command": ["C:\\Program Files\\nodejs\\node.exe", "C:\\Users\\a_wei\\AppData\\Roaming\\npm\\node_modules\\@openai\\codex\\bin\\codex.js", "exec", "--ignore-user-config", "--skip-git-repo-check", "--ephemeral", "--json", "--sandbox", "read-only", "--model", "gpt-5.6-luna", "-c", "model_provider=\"p0_chatgpt_https\"", "-c", "model_providers.p0_chatgpt_https.name=\"OpenAI\"", "-c", "model_providers.p0_chatgpt_https.base_url=\"https://chatgpt.com/backend-api/codex\"", "-c", "model_providers.p0_chatgpt_https.requires_openai_auth=true", "-c", "model_providers.p0_chatgpt_https.supports_websockets=false", "-c", "model_providers.p0_chatgpt_https.wire_api=\"responses\"", "--disable", "unbounded_connection_retries", "-c", "model_providers.p0_chatgpt_https.request_max_retries=0", "-c", "model_providers.p0_chatgpt_https.stream_max_retries=0", "--cd", "E:\\OneDrive\\project\\static_determine\\agentic_heuristic_design\\outputs\\p1_task_smoke\\20261105_133602_b6f6a25c\\tsp_aco_black_box", "-"], "started_at_utc": "2026-11-05T05:36:11.095227+00:00", "elapsed_seconds": 22.063, "exit_code": 0, "stdout": "{\"type\":\"thread.started\",\"thread_id\":\"01a1aa35-2237-7370-b401-e824bc1042a4\"}\n{\"type\":\"turn.started\"}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"<thought>For each edge, compute a robust low-cost desirability score by combining its inverse empirical percentile with a sigmoid of its robustly standardized value. Lower edge attributes receive larger indicators. The rank component remains stable under arbitrary scaling, while the robust sigmoid preserves stronger distinctions near the center and limits the influence of outliers. Constant or non-finite inputs are handled safely.</thought><code>import numpy as np\\n\\ndef heuristics_v2(edge_attr: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:\\n    x = np.asarray(edge_attr, dtype=float)\\n\\n    if x.ndim != 2 or x.shape[1] != 1:\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"edge_attr must have shape (n_edges, 1)\\\")\\n\\n    n_edges = x.shape[0]\\n    if n_edges == 0:\\n        return np.empty(0, dtype=float)\\n\\n    values = x[:, 0]\\n    finite = np.isfinite(values)\\n\\n    if not np.any(finite):\\n        return np.full(n_edges, 0.5, dtype=float)\\n\\n    valid = values[finite]\\n    median = np.median(valid)\\n    mad = np.median(np.abs(valid - median))\\n    scale = 1.4826 * mad\\n\\n    if scale <= np.finfo(float).eps:\\n        scale = np.std(valid)\\n    if scale <= np.finfo(float).eps:\\n        scale = 1.0\\n\\n    standardized = np.zeros(n_edges, dtype=float)\\n    standardized[finite] = (values[finite] - median) / scale\\n    standardized = np.clip(standardized, -12.0, 12.0)\\n\\n    order = np.argsort(np.where(finite, values, np.inf), kind=\\\"mergesort\\\")\\n    ranks = np.empty(n_edges, dtype=float)\\n    ranks[order] = np.arange(n_edges, dtype=float)\\n\\n    valid_count = np.count_nonzero(finite)\\n    if valid_count > 1:\\n        percentile = 1.0 - ranks / (valid_count - 1.0)\\n    else:\\n        percentile = np.full(n_edges, 0.5, dtype=float)\\n\\n    sigmoid = 1.0 / (1.0 + np.exp(standardized))\\n    score = 0.6 * percentile + 0.4 * sigmoid\\n\\n    score[~finite] = 0.0\\n    return np.clip(score, 0.0, 1.0)</code>\"}}\n{\"type\":\"turn.completed\",\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":23603,\"cached_input_tokens\":10496,\"cache_write_input_tokens\":0,\"output_tokens\":734,\"reasoning_output_tokens\":224}}\n", "stderr": "2026-11-05T05:36:11.324223Z  WARN codex_core::shell_snapshot: Failed to create shell snapshot for powershell: Shell snapshot not supported yet for PowerShell\n2026-11-05T05:36:11.446538Z  WARN codex_skills_extension::loader::metadata: ignoring file:///C:/Users/a_wei/.codex/skills/onedrive-zotero-library/agents/openai.yaml: failed to read openai.yaml: invalid utf-8 sequence of 1 bytes from index 45\n2026-1